        ],
        "question": "Who is Dor Sharaby?",
        "answer": "I’m Dor Sharaby, a brand and product designer based in Tel Aviv, Israel, and the founder of Pamidor Studio. I’ve been designing professionally since 2021 and opened the studio in 2023."
      },
